   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Egypt&#x2019;s Social Development Agenda and Care Systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Initiation Plan supports the scoping, design, and development of a new UNDP programme of support to the Government of Egypt on social development, ageing, elderly care, and the care economy, in partnership with the Ministry of Social Solidarity (MoSS). The initiative is aligned with the Doha Political Declaration, Egypt Vision 2030, and the proposed National Social Protection Framework (2025&#x2013;2030), and seeks to position Egypt at the forefront of emerging social development priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
